{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1469371-vault-release-familials","id":1469371,"title":"Vault Release: Familials","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-01T16:56:52-08:00","id":1469371,"title":"Vault Release: Familials","content":"<b>Familials</b> is a supplement that provides rules for spirits as playable characters, based loosely on the Absent rules, but with new traits; instead of Memory, you have Oaths and Bonds, which fill the same niche and also provide Integrity and Virtue/Vice adjacent mechanics for spirits. Unlike typical spirits, Familials have a closer connection to and understanding of humanity, those links providing them with the ability to interact with them more closely.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/379155/Familials?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/379155.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/379155/Familials?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"> Familials - White Wolf | Storytellers Vault </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/379155/Familials?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/379155/Familials?affiliate_id=259490 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Familials - Spirits are inhuman, alien creatures. Even those mirroring human concepts and emotions take those ideals to hyper focuse </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-17T01:13:50-07:00","id":1476558,"title":"","content":"What are these &quot;familials&quot; exactly<br /> <br /> I say this before buying the book to know wether i am interested on it or not","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27340-anyoneatall","name":"Anyoneatall","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-03-17T05:52:05-07:00","id":1476575,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anyoneatall</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1469371-vault-release-familials?p=1476558#post1476558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What are these &quot;familials&quot; exactly<br /> <br /> I say this before buying the book to know wether i am interested on it or not</div> </div> </div> </div>The description for the product in the link runs as follows:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Spirits are inhuman, alien creatures. Even those mirroring human concepts and emotions take those ideals to hyper focused extremes, turning something like love into a horrid obsession at the expense of everything else, or charity into a suicidal martyrdom. Few of these ephemeral beings can think in human terms, or plan things out in the long term to temper the hunger for those concepts they reflect. Some, however, grow a bit closer to humanity than is normal. <u>These are familials, spirits who have grown particularly complex through their connection to humanity (or human-like supernatural creatures).</u><br /> <br /> <b>Familials</b> provides rules for playing these spirits, allowing for players to take control of spirit characters, whether for a Chronicle focused around a choir of spirits alone, or a mixed group of spirits, shapeshifters, magic users, or otherwise. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key"